{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"agent_message","text":"The title draw selected **Killer Bee-yond Midnight**. The [original manual](https://odyssey2.info/library/manuals/us_killerbees/Killer%20Bees%20(USA).pdf) confirms the twelve-bee swarm, sustained stinging, recovering targets, maturing rivals, and horizontal ray. I’ll preserve those rules and build the garden campaign around them.\n"}}
