nd, speech wording and timing unknown |\n| https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yN8ekDBvpJY | Located Voice reference | URL supplied in plan; video not viewed or heard | No claim of matching original audio |\n| https://github.com/michaelcrosato/my-3d2dge/tree/8ecc2f62353761187bdfe226f327b7ea5d2eb691/dist/handoff | Required engine foundation | Vendored handoff README, API card, asset card, arcade kit/module, targeted implementation | v0.89.1; local extensions documented in README |\n| https://github.com/michaelcrosato/ai-hub/tree/35a1047f2067b2af3de3943f0fe452f39105d869/lib/hub | Actual multiplayer protocol | Vendored README, pristine session.js, harness/bridge/round, example | Protocol 1, client 1.4.0; arbitrary Internet NAT connectivity is not guaranteed |\n\nFocus, flying-swarm husk collision, opening charge, authored six encounters, co-op and the bell gardener are intentional additions. Original source has long wave progression; this game has a finite campaign. The title was selected once by crypto.randomInt(50), recorded in identity.json. No source artwork/audio is copied.\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"cp: cannot stat 'vendor/hub-repo/LICENSE': No such file or directory\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
