{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_60","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('../PROGRESS.md')\np.write_text(p.read_text()+'''\\\\n## Gate A / implementation checkpoint\\\\n- Vendored my-3D2dge v0.89.1 at 8ecc2f6 and pristine AI Hub client 1.4.0 at 35a1047, with official harness/bridge/round.\\\\n- Source manual and both creator interviews inspected; research.md records evidence and unknown audio/video details.\\\\n- Reproducible single HTML build: \"'`node tools/build.mjs` from the dev folder. First artifact built (about 1.35 MiB).'\"\\\\n- Pure fixed-step simulation, six structured encounters, boss routine, validated geometry, route-changing husks, one-shot scores/refills, checkpoint retry.\\\\n- Native overhead renderer, E.Blob-derived insect/gardener rigs, E.SHAPES scenery, native E.Menu/E.Shell settings/input, generated music/SFX/voices.\\\\n- Main integration includes couch, Hub authority, direct manual WebRTC, attract, developer tools, About pages. Not yet all verified.\\\\n\\\\n## Immediate next steps\\\\n- Inspect first browser smoke screenshots/errors.\\\\n- Finish normal-rule pilot survival through all six encounters; navigation-edge fix already made.\\\\n- Build quiet \"'`node tools/test.mjs` with simulation, browser, audio, real Hub harness and real two-context WebRTC.'\"\\\\n- Fix verified issues, inspect portrait/TV/boss/credits, populate honest final interview and export.\\\\n\\\\n## Current test observations\\\\n- Pilot initially froze when a legal swarm centroid sat just outside the navigation lattice clearance. Added deterministic route recovery. This was a pilot bug, not a campaign win bypass.\\\\n- Normal solo pilot now reaches encounter 4; later survival balance remains under investigation.\\\\n- No physical controller/touch/iOS/TV/listener or public Internet connection is available. Use installed browser stand-ins as TASK specifies.\\\\n''')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_60","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('../PROGRESS.md')\np.write_text(p.read_text()+'''\\\\n## Gate A / implementation checkpoint\\\\n- Vendored my-3D2dge v0.89.1 at 8ecc2f6 and pristine AI Hub client 1.4.0 at 35a1047, with official harness/bridge/round.\\\\n- Source manual and both creator interviews inspected; research.md records evidence and unknown audio/video details.\\\\n- Reproducible single HTML build: \"'`node tools/build.mjs` from the dev folder. First artifact built (about 1.35 MiB).'\"\\\\n- Pure fixed-step simulation, six structured encounters, boss routine, validated geometry, route-changing husks, one-shot scores/refills, checkpoint retry.\\\\n- Native overhead renderer, E.Blob-derived insect/gardener rigs, E.SHAPES scenery, native E.Menu/E.Shell settings/input, generated music/SFX/voices.\\\\n- Main integration includes couch, Hub authority, direct manual WebRTC, attract, developer tools, About pages. Not yet all verified.\\\\n\\\\n## Immediate next steps\\\\n- Inspect first browser smoke screenshots/errors.\\\\n- Finish normal-rule pilot survival through all six encounters; navigation-edge fix already made.\\\\n- Build quiet \"'`node tools/test.mjs` with simulation, browser, audio, real Hub harness and real two-context WebRTC.'\"\\\\n- Fix verified issues, inspect portrait/TV/boss/credits, populate honest final interview and export.\\\\n\\\\n## Current test observations\\\\n- Pilot initially froze when a legal swarm centroid sat just outside the navigation lattice clearance. Added deterministic route recovery. This was a pilot bug, not a campaign win bypass.\\\\n- Normal solo pilot now reaches encounter 4; later survival balance remains under investigation.\\\\n- No physical controller/touch/iOS/TV/listener or public Internet connection is available. Use installed browser stand-ins as TASK specifies.\\\\n''')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_61","type":"agent_message","text":"The normal-rules two-player pilot completed all six encounters in **11 minutes 2 seconds**, including the Bellwether, with both swarms surviving. The packaged file opens without console errors. The browser smoke test also found that pressing Play creates the run but leaves the title scene visible; I’m tracing that transition before running the full checks.\n"}}
