{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_76","type":"agent_message","text":"The official two-player Hub harness passes, and two browser contexts exchanged real WebRTC offer/answer codes and moved the guest’s swarm on the host. Simulation tests also caught an order-dependent co-op bug: the first collapsing shell could push a player away before the second target’s sting was counted. I changed the update order to collect all sting damage before resolving collapses.\n"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_77","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\np='src/main.js';s=open(p).read().replace(\\\"import {GardenAudio} from './presentation/audio.js';\\\", \\\"import {GardenAudio,syllable} from './presentation/audio.js';\\\");s=s.replace(\\\"const debug={game,app,identity,interview,\\\", \\\"const debug={game,app,identity,interview,offlineVoice:async()=>{const C=globalThis.OfflineAudioContext||globalThis.webkitOfflineAudioContext;const c=new C(1,44100,44100),gain=c.createGain();gain.connect(c.destination);syllable(c,gain,.02,520,.12,.4);const buffer=await c.startRendering(),data=buffer.getChannelData(0);let peak=0,energy=0,tail=0,finite=true;for(let i=0;i<data.length;i++){const v=data[i];if(\"'!Number.isFinite(v))finite=false;peak=Math.max(peak,Math.abs(v));energy+=v*v;if(i>22050)tail+=v*v;}return{peak,rms:Math.sqrt(energy/data.length),tail,finite};},\");open(p,'\"'w').write(s)\nPY\nnode tools/build.mjs\nnode tools/test.mjs --group=sim\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
